      "level": 0, "kind": "root", "path": "",
      "html": "<p>This spec covers token issuance, rotation, and session idle handling for the orbiter API.</p>",
      "has_mermaid": false, "line_start": 1, "line_end": 5,
      "open_notes": 0, "tasks": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1, "slug": "overview", "pin": null, "number": "1", "heading": "Overview",
      "level": 1, "kind": "heading", "path": "Overview",
      "html": "<p>Clients authenticate with short-lived access tokens backed by longer-lived refresh tokens.</p>",
      "has_mermaid": false, "line_start": 7, "line_end": 11,
      "open_notes": 0, "tasks": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2, "slug": "tokens", "pin": null, "number": "2", "heading": "Tokens",
      "level": 1, "kind": "heading", "path": "Tokens",
      "html": "<p>Two token kinds: access (15m) and refresh (30d).</p>",
      "has_mermaid": false, "line_start": 13, "line_end": 17,
      "open_notes": 0, "tasks": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3, "slug": "tokens__rotation", "pin": "grace-policy", "number": "2.1",
      "heading": "Rotation", "level": 3, "kind": "heading", "path": "Tokens / Rotation",
      "html": "<p>On refresh, the old refresh token stays valid for a grace window of 60s to absorb in-flight requests, then is revoked.</p>",
      "has_mermaid": false, "line_start": 19, "line_end": 27,
      "open_notes": 1, "tasks": [12, 13]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4, "slug": "sessions", "pin": null, "number": "3", "heading": "Sessions",
      "level": 1, "kind": "heading", "path": "Sessions",
      "html": "<p>A session tracks the device and the currently active refresh token.</p>",
      "has_mermaid": false, "line_start": 29, "line_end": 33,
      "open_notes": 0, "tasks": []
    },
    {
